      "created_at": "2016-12-25T13:02:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the couple games I've tried with her, she feels like a slightly harder version of Kismet, but given Kismet's usually a pushover, that's not saying much. She's easy to manipulate, yes, but her big problem is being the One Big Villain Target. And starting the heroes with the Talisman removes her big damage self-boost.</p>",
