      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-12-31T01:21:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just tried out her advanced rules the other day, and that really cranks her up to a decent threat. Like, even regular advanced Kismet isn't that bad, but with extra damage and extra card plays, whoosh!</p>",
