      "created_at": "2017-01-07T17:51:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I quite like Villains! It really made a less impressive way to play the game (Vengeance style) something that isn't immediately dismissed at the table. Preferred? Still no, but it is indeed quite fun when everyone is in the mood for a Team v Team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, yes. Agreed!</p>",
